completed_at: "2026-10-21T18:56:58.695Z"
author: codex-agent
acceptance_criteria: Default concurrent npm test remains reliable under host contention without bypassing production lease expiry enforcement; Retain real installed CLI and HTTP coverage and explicit expiry refusal regressions
parent: pm-vcs-5h6j
resolution: Delivered by the audit-linked mainline implementation.
expected_result: Prevent served CLI fixture leases expiring during concurrent npm test.
actual_result: "Re-verified unchanged main 27e1d84671fa: delivery 24f6a937d084 remains in main ancestry; test/served-forge.test.ts remain present."
comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-16T00:48:18.128Z",codex-agent,"Evidence: the initial full default-concurrency Node-only npm test had 1549 passed, 1 failed, 4 expected Bun skips; installed served-forge CLI failed its final push with lease_expired after 86.364 seconds. This test and its lease fixture are unchanged from main. It passed in both serial release gates (48.649 and 27.070 seconds), a focused Node-only rerun (1/1), and the unchanged full Node-only retry (57.810 seconds; 1550 passed, 0 failed, 4 Bun skips). No production lease check, test assertion, timeout or fixture lifetime was changed. Keep this follow-up open for deterministic fixture renewal or lifetime handling under contention."
  "2026-10-19T00:41:38.576Z",codex-agent,"Reproduced during PR #126 certification on source 87e0b0049d5506f3d792c6236701cca6a2a9ffcf: npm release gate completed 1634/1635 tests, with only the unchanged installed served-forge CLI scenario failing its final push with lease_expired after 84.517 seconds. git diff origin/main -- test/served-forge.test.ts is empty. The same full Bun release gate passed 1635/1635 with all 67 production files at 100%. Reusing this existing issue. The fixture acquires 60000 ms while its existing scenario timeout is 180000 ms. Plan: share the existing 180000 ms budget between the scenario timeout and this non-expiry fixture lease. No production lease duration, validation, explicit 1 ms expiry test, assertion or test timeout will change. Prove the boundary with a real delayed installed-CLI scenario and only the fixture lifetime reverted; then refresh the required gates."
  "2026-10-19T00:48:25.652Z",codex-agent,"Controlled behavioral proof uses the existing installed-CLI/real-HTTP scenario in an isolated source copy, rebuilt compiled extension bytes, and an added 65-second delay before its final push. With the shared existing 180000 ms fixture budget as lease lifetime: 1/1 pass, exit 0, scenario 124.401 seconds. Revert only that acquisition lifetime to 60000 ms: 0/1 pass, exit 1, final push returns lease_expired. Both retain the unchanged 180000 ms test timeout and every original assertion; no SDK mocks or production lease edits. Normal linked acceptance via pm test pm-vcs-forgeleaseexpiry --run --only-last --progress passes 1/1, exit 0. Build:test and lint pass. Explicit 1 ms expired-grant refusal coverage remains unchanged. The fixture lifetime now covers its allowed execution budget instead of silently relying on fast CLI startups."
  "2026-10-19T01:39:22.136Z",codex-agent,"Final full validation binds source b75a4434f0c1fd4f71b069289cb3cb2d9c590e71. npm run release:check AND bun run release:check both exit 0 with fresh HOME and disabled global/system Git identity in independent full-history checkouts. Each: 1635/1635 tests, zero failures/skips/cancellations/TODO; c8 --all --100 --per-file: all 67 production files, 23286 statements/lines, 7211 branches, 795 functions, every dimension 100%. ESLint zero warnings; jscpd zero clone pairs/0%; docstrings 67 files/362 declarations; native TOON, installed-CLI stat-cache strace, committed self-host, production/identity audits, pack, changelog and attestation checks all pass. Exact-source CI run 39182485481 passes Linux Node 22/26 and Windows acceptance; CodeQL run 39182485467 passes. No threshold, dependency pin, release workflow or production lease rule changed. The successful-publication fixture now shares its unchanged 180000 ms execution budget with its requested lease lifetime. Explicit 1 ms expired-grant refusal assertions and production expiry validation remain unchanged. Controlled real-HTTP/installed-CLI schedule with an added 65-second wait before final push: candidate 1/1 pass, only lease lifetime reverted to 60000 ms 0/1 pass and lease_expired. Normal linked fixture via pm test pm-vcs-forgeleaseexpiry --run --only-last --progress passes 1/1. The older Node-only default-concurrency test link is preserved as historical evidence; this run uses the requested full serial release gates plus the deterministic delayed native fixture proof. Keeping this item in_progress for orchestrator verification; releasing the claim without closing it."
  "2026-10-21T18:56:37.166Z",codex-agent,"Tracker reconciliation authorized for the audited verdict FIXED-STALE. Re-verified unchanged main 27e1d84671fa: delivery 24f6a937d084 remains in main ancestry; engine/annotate.ts, test/annotate.test.ts remain present. Prevent served CLI fixture leases expiring during concurrent npm test. [PR #126](https://github.com/unbraind/pm-vcs/pull/126) includes the fixture lifetime fix; a delayed real-HTTP installed-CLI proof passes while reverting only the lease lifetime produces lease_expired. Scope: tracker state only; no new runtime certification or deployment claim."
